# Force LF line endings for anything that gets executed as a script or parsed by
# tools that choke on \r (shebangs especially). This repo mixes a Windows dev
# machine with a Linux-only build (WSL/Docker), so without this, checking the
# repo out on Windows silently reintroduces CRLF and breaks every shell script's
# shebang line ("/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory").
*.sh text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.sol text eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
